# Wave T41 (Shingle kit): shellfloor — Shingle Town's own
# street kind. RAKED SHINGLE-SAND: pale shell-sand (#d9c491
# body) combed into fine horizontal rake grooves every four
# pixels, strewn with shell chips — white shell shards, a
# pink shell fleck, grey pebbles — in loose tide-line drifts.
# Structurally unlike the beach's own unraked psand speckle
# (byte-kept beside it), Wildflower's petal scatter on cream
# gravel and Clover's flecked packed earth. The registered
# street material of the town's front street, gate lanes and
# cottage lanes. (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T41-SHINGLE-PLAN.md.)
